<title>SINGAPORE: IME half year 1996/97 net profit eases.</title>
<headline>IME half year 1996/97 net profit eases.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 0.42	 vs	  0.46</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)    0.53	 vs	  0.69</p>
<p>    Turnover		  95.22	 vs	 81.01</p>
<p>    Other income	     0.29	 vs	  0.27</p>
<p>    Interest expense	 0.023	vs	  0.015</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   1.01	 vs	  0.81</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.30	 vs	  0.24</p>
<p>    Minorities	(loss) 0.28	 vs	  0.13 (loss)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (loss) 0.13	 vs	  0.73 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - IMM Multi-Enterprise Ltd (IME) is a retail, wholesale and entertainment company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
</text>
